{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1842. Behind you, the life you knew. Ahead, the western frontier - miles of open sky, untouched valleys and adventure. Out here, the land is rich, the rivers run clean, and what you make of it is yours to keep. All you need is the frontier ahead, friends beside you, and the will to build a new life from the ground up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wild West won't make it easy. But you didn't come out here for easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your homestead from a canvas tent to a ranch on the western frontier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel</strong> by wagon, break camp and push further west to settle new land</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt, fish and farm</strong> to feed yourself and your companions through every season</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong> tools, weapons and gear to carve out your place on the frontier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> blistering summers, violent storms and bitter frontier winters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a vast open world alive with beauty, danger and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play</strong> solo or with up to <strong>4 players in co-op</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Rust Pioneers brings together the deep survival crafting and base building of <i>Valheim</i> and <i>The Forest</i> with the rugged beauty of <i>Red Dead Redemption 2</i>, set on a living, breathing western frontier.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/23497255e9d2e7bea75433dc6778c4a2.webp?t=1773964802\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD &amp; SETTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You didn't come west just to survive.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came to build something. A canvas tent becomes a cabin. A cabin becomes a homestead. A homestead becomes a ranch. With your own two hands and the hands of your companions, you'll build a new life in the wide open wilderness of Red Rust Valley, one timber frame and campfire at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The frontier is free and it's waiting. What you make of it is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/fa714118c8550ff1f0ae91c8daacfb13.poster.avif?t=1773964802\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/fa714118c8550ff1f0ae91c8daacfb13.webm?t=1773964802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/fa714118c8550ff1f0ae91c8daacfb13.mp4?t=1773964802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/23497255e9d2e7bea75433dc6778c4a2.webp?t=1773964802\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE &amp; ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The wilderness beyond your door is yours to explore.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your homestead is your anchor. When you're ready, load your wagon, break camp, and ride out into the wilderness. New country reveals fresh resources, hidden valleys and breathtaking vistas you'll want to share with your companions. And when your saddlebags are full and the sun is dropping, there's nothing quite like the ride home, wagon loaded, ready to build something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition brings something back to make your homestead a little stronger, a little larger, a little more your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/db8851204fab66eeae604ad6db82aa4d.avif?t=1773964802\" width=618 height=270 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/23497255e9d2e7bea75433dc6778c4a2.webp?t=1773964802\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIVE OFF THE LAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>But first, you have to survive it.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wild West doesn't care about your plans. Battle hunger, thirst, and the unforgiving elements as you forage, hunt, and fish to stay alive. Farm and harvest crops to build a self-sufficient camp. Venture into the mountains for the resources that'll give you an edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the seasons. Scorching summers, violent rainstorms and freezing winters stand between you and the life you're building. Respect the frontier, and it will reward you. Defy it, and the west has a long memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/4d4b657273fc54a12d3b003092bc0f80.poster.avif?t=1773964802\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/4d4b657273fc54a12d3b003092bc0f80.webm?t=1773964802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/4d4b657273fc54a12d3b003092bc0f80.mp4?t=1773964802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/23497255e9d2e7bea75433dc6778c4a2.webp?t=1773964802\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOOD COMPANY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The trail is better with friends beside you.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite up to three friends into your world - split the work and share the adventure. Ride out into the wilderness, set up camp beneath the stars, and build a homestead and new life together. Red Rust Pioneers is built from the ground up for co-operative play, and the frontier is a better place for it. <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/9c3c0e1411ae340c34b93b2a98af3347.poster.avif?t=1773964802\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/9c3c0e1411ae340c34b93b2a98af3347.webm?t=1773964802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/9c3c0e1411ae340c34b93b2a98af3347.mp4?t=1773964802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The frontier is waiting. Your story starts here.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664440?t=1773964802","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/5328616af2dd273364747b2678eb1433da83388d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773964802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/8fb42ebf38c5801720b2325903bd16281f9868a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773964802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/8fb42ebf38c5801720b2325903bd16281f9868a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773964802","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1842. Behind you, the life you knew. Ahead, the western frontier - miles of open sky, untouched valleys and adventure. Out here, the land is rich, the rivers run clean, and what you make of it is yours to keep. All you need is the frontier ahead, friends beside you, and the will to build a new life from the ground up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wild West won't make it easy. But you didn't come out here for easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your homestead from a canvas tent to a ranch on the western frontier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel</strong> by wagon, break camp and push further west to settle new land</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt, fish and farm</strong> to feed yourself and your companions through every season</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong> tools, weapons and gear to carve out your place on the frontier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> blistering summers, violent storms and bitter frontier winters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a vast open world alive with beauty, danger and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play</strong> solo or with up to <strong>4 players in co-op</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Rust Pioneers brings together the deep survival crafting and base building of <i>Valheim</i> and <i>The Forest</i> with the rugged beauty of <i>Red Dead Redemption 2</i>, set on a living, breathing western frontier.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/23497255e9d2e7bea75433dc6778c4a2.webp?t=1773964802\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD &amp; SETTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You didn't come west just to survive.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came to build something. A canvas tent becomes a cabin. A cabin becomes a homestead. A homestead becomes a ranch. With your own two hands and the hands of your companions, you'll build a new life in the wide open wilderness of Red Rust Valley, one timber frame and campfire at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The frontier is free and it's waiting. What you make of it is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/fa714118c8550ff1f0ae91c8daacfb13.poster.avif?t=1773964802\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/fa714118c8550ff1f0ae91c8daacfb13.webm?t=1773964802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/fa714118c8550ff1f0ae91c8daacfb13.mp4?t=1773964802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/23497255e9d2e7bea75433dc6778c4a2.webp?t=1773964802\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE &amp; ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The wilderness beyond your door is yours to explore.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your homestead is your anchor. When you're ready, load your wagon, break camp, and ride out into the wilderness. New country reveals fresh resources, hidden valleys and breathtaking vistas you'll want to share with your companions. And when your saddlebags are full and the sun is dropping, there's nothing quite like the ride home, wagon loaded, ready to build something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition brings something back to make your homestead a little stronger, a little larger, a little more your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/db8851204fab66eeae604ad6db82aa4d.avif?t=1773964802\" width=618 height=270 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/23497255e9d2e7bea75433dc6778c4a2.webp?t=1773964802\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIVE OFF THE LAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>But first, you have to survive it.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wild West doesn't care about your plans. Battle hunger, thirst, and the unforgiving elements as you forage, hunt, and fish to stay alive. Farm and harvest crops to build a self-sufficient camp. Venture into the mountains for the resources that'll give you an edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the seasons. Scorching summers, violent rainstorms and freezing winters stand between you and the life you're building. Respect the frontier, and it will reward you. Defy it, and the west has a long memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/4d4b657273fc54a12d3b003092bc0f80.poster.avif?t=1773964802\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/4d4b657273fc54a12d3b003092bc0f80.webm?t=1773964802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/4d4b657273fc54a12d3b003092bc0f80.mp4?t=1773964802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/23497255e9d2e7bea75433dc6778c4a2.webp?t=1773964802\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOOD COMPANY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The trail is better with friends beside you.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite up to three friends into your world - split the work and share the adventure. Ride out into the wilderness, set up camp beneath the stars, and build a homestead and new life together. Red Rust Pioneers is built from the ground up for co-operative play, and the frontier is a better place for it. <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/9c3c0e1411ae340c34b93b2a98af3347.poster.avif?t=1773964802\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/9c3c0e1411ae340c34b93b2a98af3347.webm?t=1773964802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/9c3c0e1411ae340c34b93b2a98af3347.mp4?t=1773964802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The frontier is waiting. Your story starts here.</p>","developers":["Rusty Robot"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/28b9139a0088d8ccce2eb263f7bd5c4c0c09a2d9/header.jpg?t=1773